{"id":"624080","name":"凉拌鱼腥草折耳根","author":"Hhxj","authorId":"12848515","desc":"","cover":"images/624080/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"鱼腥草","amount":"150g"}],"sub":[{"name":"干红辣椒","amount":"3个"},{"name":"蒜","amount":"3个"},{"name":"小葱","amount":"2颗"},{"name":"香菜","amount":"2棵"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"食材同框。","img":"images/624080/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"鱼腥草洗净，折成小段。","img":"images/624080/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"把剁碎的蒜末放入碗中。","img":"images/624080/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"加入盐。","img":"images/624080/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"倒入白糖搅拌均匀，腌制20分钟。","img":"images/624080/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"鱼腥草中有少许水分渗出，倒掉不要。","img":"images/624080/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"把辣椒切成小圈放入小碗中。","img":"images/624080/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"锅里放少许油，烧热。","img":"images/624080/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"倒入碗中。","img":"images/624080/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"加入少许麻油。","img":"images/624080/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"倒入2中勺醋。","img":"images/624080/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"加入2中勺酱油。","img":"images/624080/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"把调好的佐料汁倒入鱼腥草中。","img":"images/624080/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"拌匀。","img":"images/624080/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"放上葱花。","img":"images/624080/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"加上香菜，喜欢吃辣的还可以倒入红油拌匀。","img":"images/624080/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"漂漂亮亮装盘上桌，开吃！","img":"images/624080/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/624080/step_18.jpg"}],"tips":"加入白糖腌制，可以更好地去除鱼腥草中的涩味。\n \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：其他\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}